sequenceDiagram
    title COREP Capital Return — Happy Path (JRN-017)

    actor HeadRegRep as Head of Reg Reporting (PER-059)
    actor CRO as CRO / SMF4 (PER-059)
    actor CFO as CFO / SMF2 (PER-059)
    participant CH005 as Internal Tooling (CH-005)
    participant CAP004 as CAP-004 Risk Management API
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005 Compliance & Regulatory API
    participant EB as Event Bus
    participant SVC103 as Audit & Logging (SVC-103)
    participant SVC111 as WORM Store (SVC-111)
    participant PRA as PRA RegData

    note over HeadRegRep, PRA: PH-088 — Capital Data Extraction and RWA Calculation

    HeadRegRep->>CH005: Initiate COREP reporting cycle
    CH005->>CAP004: POST /capital-data-packages/{id}/trigger-extraction
    CAP004-->>CH005: 202 Accepted
    CAP004->>EB: CapitalDataExtractionRequested (EVT-119)
    CAP004->>SVC103: Log extraction start + data lineage

    note over CAP004: Batch calculations (~8 hours)

    CAP004->>EB: CreditRiskRWACalculated (EVT-120)
    CAP004->>EB: MarketRiskRWACalculated (EVT-121)
    CAP004->>EB: OperationalRiskRWACalculated (EVT-122)
    CAP004->>EB: CapitalDataPackageAssembled (EVT-123)

    CRO->>CH005: Review RWA outputs
    CH005->>CAP004: GET /capital-data-packages/{id}
    CAP004-->>CH005: 200 OK — RWA detail

    note over HeadRegRep, PRA: PH-089 — Return Consolidation and Formatting

    EB->>CAP005: Deliver CapitalDataPackageAssembled (EVT-123)
    CAP005->>SVC103: Log capital data receipt
    note over CAP005: Automated mapping + manual classification (~5 days)
    CAP005->>EB: COREPReturnDraftGenerated (EVT-124)

    note over HeadRegRep, PRA: PH-090 — Validation and Quality Assurance

    HeadRegRep->>CH005: Trigger validation
    CH005->>CAP005: POST /corep-returns/{id}/validate
    CAP005-->>CH005: 202 Accepted
    note over CAP005: XBRL validation + variance analysis + GL reconciliation
    CAP005->>SVC103: Log validation results
    CAP005->>EB: COREPValidationCompleted (EVT-125) — PASS

    note over HeadRegRep, PRA: PH-091 — CFO Sign-Off and Submission

    CFO->>CH005: Review return + sign attestation
    CH005->>CAP005: POST /corep-returns/{id}/signoff
    CAP005->>SVC111: Store CFO attestation (WORM)
    CAP005-->>CH005: 200 OK — sign-off recorded
    CAP005->>EB: COREPReturnApproved (EVT-126)

    HeadRegRep->>CH005: Trigger PRA submission
    CH005->>CAP005: POST /corep-returns/{id}/submit
    CAP005->>PRA: Submit COREP XBRL return
    PRA-->>CAP005: Acknowledgement + reference
    CAP005->>SVC111: Store submission confirmation (WORM)
    CAP005->>EB: COREPReturnSubmitted (EVT-127)
    CAP005->>EB: COREPReturnAcknowledged (EVT-128)

    note over HeadRegRep, PRA: PH-092 — Post-Submission Monitoring

    CAP005->>SVC103: Log monitoring period start
